        <obo:IAO_0000115>A triazole-based antifungal agent used for the treatment of esophageal candidiasis, invasive pulmonary aspergillosis, and serious fungal infections caused by &lt;em&gt;Scedosporium apiospermum&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Fusarium&lt;/em&gt; spp. It is an inhibitor of cytochrome P450 2C9 (CYP2C9) and CYP3A4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
