        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24532"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A monohydroxypyridine that is pyridine substituted by a hydroxy group at position 3, an aminomethyl group at position 4, a hydroxymethyl group at position 5 and a methyl group at position 2. The 4-aminomethyl form of vitamin B&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;6&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;, it is used (in the form of the hydrochloride salt) for treatment of diabetic nephropathy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
