        <obo:IAO_0000115>A 6-oxo steroid that is 5β-cholest-7-en-6-one substituted by hydroxy groups at positions 2, 3, 14, 22 and 25 respectively (the 2β, 3β, 22&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt; stereoisomer). It is a steroid prohormone of the major insect moulting hormone 20-hydroxyecdysone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
