        <obo:IAO_0000115>A C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;21&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;-steroid hormone in which a pregnane skeleton carries oxo substituents at positions 3 and 20 and is unsaturated at C(4)-C(5). As a hormone, it is involved in the female menstrual cycle, pregnancy and embryogenesis of humans and other species.</obo:IAO_0000115>
