        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24913"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>One of a class of tetraterpenoids (C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;40&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;), formally derived from the acyclic parent, ψ,ψ-carotene by hydrogenation, dehydrogenation, cyclization, oxidation, or combination of these processes. This class includes carotenes, xanthophylls and certain compounds that arise from rearrangement of the skeleton of ψ,ψ-carotene or by loss of part of this structure. Retinoids are excluded.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>cas:36-88-4</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>carotenoid</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
