        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The oxime carbamate resulting from the addition of 2-methyl-2-(methylsulfanyl)propanaldoxime to methyl isocyanate. A member of the class of oxime carbamate insecticides, aldicarb is a mixture of &lt;i&gt;E&lt;/i&gt; and &lt;i&gt;Z&lt;/i&gt; isomers; it is not known which isomer is more active.</obo:IAO_0000115>
