    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_2766">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24913"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tetracyclic diterpenoid that has an tetradecahydro-8,11a-methanocyclohepta[&lt;em&gt;a&lt;/em&gt;]naphthalene skeleton with two hydroxymethyl substituents at positions 4 and 9, two methyl substituents at positions 4 and 11b and two hydroxy substituents at positions 3 and 9. An antibiotic with antiviral and antimitotical properties. Aphidicolin is a reversible inhibitor of eukaryotic nuclear DNA replication.</obo:IAO_0000115>
