        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of rotenones that consists of 1,2,12,12a-tetrahydrochromeno[3,4-&lt;em&gt;b&lt;/em&gt;]furo[2,3-&lt;em&gt;h&lt;/em&gt;]chromen-6(6a&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;)-one substituted at position 2 by a prop-1-en-2-yl group and at positions 8 and 9 by methoxy groups (the 2&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;,6a&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;,12a&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;-isomer). A non-systemic insecticide, it is the principal insecticidal constituent of derris (the dried rhizome and root of &lt;em&gt;Derris elliptica&lt;/em&gt;).</obo:IAO_0000115>
