        <obo:IAO_0000115>An oligomycin with formula C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;45&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;H&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;74&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;0&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;11&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;. An inhibitor of mitochondrial F&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;F&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;O&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; ATP synthase that induces apoptosis in a variety of cell types and exhibits antifungal, antitumour, and nematicidal activities, but its clinical application has been limited by poor solubility in water and other biocompatible solvents.</obo:IAO_0000115>
