        <obo:IAO_0000115>A C&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;19&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;-gibberellin that is a pentacyclic diterpenoid responsible for promoting growth and elongation of cells in plants.  Initially identified in &lt;em&gt;Gibberella fujikuroi&lt;/em&gt;,it differs from gibberellin A&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; in the presence of a double bond between C-3 and C-4.</obo:IAO_0000115>
