    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_29699">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A mixture of antiviral nucleoside antibiotics produced by &lt;em&gt;Streptomyces lysosuperificus&lt;/em&gt;. It contains at least 10 homologues comprising uracil, &lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;-acetylglucosamine, an 11-carbon aminodialdose called tunicamine, and a fatty acid linked to the amino group of the tunicamine.  The homologues vary in the composition of the fatty acid moiety.</obo:IAO_0000115>
