        <obo:IAO_0000115>A 3-hydroxy steroid that is 17β-estradiol in which the 7α hydrogen has been replaced by a nonyl group in which one of the hydrogens of the terminal methyl has been replaced by a (4,4,5,5,5-pentafluoropentyl)sulfinyl group. An estrogen receptor antagonist, it is used in the treatment of breast cancer.</obo:IAO_0000115>
