    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_31899">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A racemate composed of (2&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;,3&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;)- and (2&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;,3&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;)-enantiomers of nemonapride. Highly potent dopamine D&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;-like receptor antagonist; selective over D&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;-like receptors (Ki values are 0.1 and 740 nM for D&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;-like and D&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;-like receptors respectively). Also potent 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1A&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; receptor agonist (IC&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;50&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; = 34 nM) and has affinity for sigma receptors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
