        <obo:IAO_0000115>A phenol that is a natural monoterpene derivative of cymene. An inhibitor of  bacterial growth, it is used as a food additive. Potent activator of the human ion channels transient receptor potential V3 (TRPV3) and A1 (TRPA1).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>beilstein:1860514</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
