        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_16670"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cyclic nonribosomal peptide of eleven amino acids; an immunosuppressant drug widely used in post-allogeneic organ transplant to reduce the activity of the patient&apos;s immune system, and therefore the risk of organ rejection. Also causes reversible inhibition of immunocompetent lymphocytes in the G0- and G1-phase of the cell cycle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
