        <obo:IAO_0000115>An alanine derivative that is &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-alanine bearing a 5-fluorouracil-1-yl substituent at position 3. A more potent and selective AMPA receptor agonist (at hGluR1 and hGluR2) than AMPA itself (Ki = 14.7, 25.1, and 1820 nM for hGluR1, hGluR2 and hGluR5 respectively).</obo:IAO_0000115>
