        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A secondary amino compound that is (&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;)-colchicine in which the &lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;-acetyl group is replaced by an &lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;-methyl group. Isolable from the autumn crocus, &lt;em&gt;Colchicum autumnale&lt;/em&gt;, it is less toxic than colchicine and is used as an antineoplastic.</obo:IAO_0000115>
