        <obo:IAO_0000115>A metallic element predicted as eka-aluminium by Mendeleev in 1870 and discovered by Paul-Emile Lecoq de Boisbaudran in 1875. Named in honour of France (Latin &lt;em&gt;Gallia&lt;/em&gt;) and perhaps also from the Latin &lt;em&gt;gallus&lt;/em&gt; cock, a translation of Lecoq.</obo:IAO_0000115>
