    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_5692">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of chlorobenzenes that is benzene in which all of the hydrogens are replaced by chlorines. An agricultural fungicide introduced in the mid-1940s and formerly used as a seed treatment, its use has been banned since 1984 under the Stockholm Convention on Persistent Organic Pollutants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
