        <obo:IAO_0000115>A retinoic acid that is &lt;i&gt;all&lt;/i&gt;-&lt;i&gt;trans&lt;/i&gt;-retinoic acid in which the double bond which is α,β- to the carboxy group is isomerised to &lt;i&gt;Z&lt;/i&gt; configuration. A synthetic retinoid, it is used for the treatment of severe cases of acne and other skin diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
