        <obo:IAO_0000115>A tricarboxylic acid dianion that is obtained from γ-carboxy-&lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-glutamic acid by removal of a proton from each of the carboxy groups and protonation of the amino group; the resulting entity has an overall charge of 2−.</obo:IAO_0000115>
