        <obo:IAO_0000115>A dipyridodiazepine that is  5,11-dihydro-6&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;-dipyrido[3,2-&lt;em&gt;b&lt;/em&gt;:2&apos;,3&apos;-&lt;em&gt;e&lt;/em&gt;][1,4]diazepine which is substituted by methyl, oxo, and cyclopropyl groups at positions 4, 6, and 11, respectively. A non-nucleoside reverse transcriptase inhibitor with activity against HIV-1, it is used in combination with other antiretrovirals for the treatment of HIV infection.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>CHEBI:7546</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
