        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hexose derivative that is 2,3:4,5-di-&lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-isopropylidene-β-&lt;small&gt;D&lt;/small&gt;-fructopyranose in which the hydroxy group has been converted to the corresponding sulfamate ester. It blocks voltage-dependent sodium channels and is used as an antiepileptic and for the prevention of migraine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
