    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64067 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_64067">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hydrochloride that is the monohydrochloride salt of SB 224289. Selective 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1B&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; receptor antagonist (pKi = 8.2). Displays &gt;60-fold selectivity over 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1D&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;, 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1A&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;, 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1E&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;, 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;1F&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;, 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2A&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; and 5-HT&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2C&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; receptors in radioligand binding and functional assays. Centrally active following oral administration in vivo.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>pubmed:20306273</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>reaxys:8248456</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>(1&apos;-methyl-6,7-dihydro-5H-spiro[furo[2,3-f]indole-3,4&apos;-piperidin]-5-yl)[2&apos;-methyl-4&apos;-(5-methyl-1,2,4-oxadiazol-3-yl)biphenyl-4-yl]methanone hydrochloride</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>1&apos;-methyl-5-{[2&apos;-methyl-4&apos;-(5-methyl-1,2,4-oxadiazol-3-yl)biphenyl-4-yl]carbonyl}-6,7-dihydro-5H-spiro[furo[2,3-f]indole-3,4&apos;-piperidinium] chloride</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
