        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hydrochloride salt obtained by reaction of (2&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;,3&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;)-EHNA with one equivalent of hydrochloric acid. Selective inhibitor of cGMP-stimulated phosphodiesterase (PDE&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt;) (IC&lt;small&gt;&lt;sub&gt;50&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/small&gt; = 0.8 - 4 mM). Also a potent inhibitor of adenosine deaminase.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>reaxys:4729841</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>(2R,3S)-3-(6-amino-9H-purin-9-yl)nonan-2-ol hydrochloride</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
