        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_37622"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A 19-membered macrocyle that is geldanamycin in which the methoxy substituent attached to the benzoquinone moiety has been replaced by an allylamino group. It is a potent inhibitor of heat shock protein 90 (Hsp90). A less toxic analogue than geldanamycin, it induces apoptosis and displays antitumour effects.</obo:IAO_0000115>
