        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>1-methyl-4-[8-(methylthio)-10,11-dihydrodibenzo[b,f]thiepin-10-yl]piperazine (2Z)-but-2-enedioate</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>1-methyl-4-[8-(methylthio)-10,11-dihydrodibenzo[b,f]thiepin-10-yl]piperazine maleate</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
