        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_60479"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A lysophosphatidylcholine in which the acyl group contains 20 carbons and 5 double bonds. If R1 is the acyl group and R2 is a hydrogen then the molecule is a 1-acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphocholine. If R1 is a hydrogen and R2 is the acyl group then the molecule is a 2-acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphocholine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>pubmed:19347970</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
