        <obo:IAO_0000115>An lysophosphatidylcholine in which the acyl group is hexadecenoyl (position of double bond not specified). If R1 is hexadecenoyl and R2 is a hydrogen then the molecule is a 1-acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphocholine. If R1 is a hydrogen and R2 is hexadecenoyl then the molecule is a 2-acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphocholine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
