        <obo:IAO_0000115>An acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine in which the acyl group contains twenty carbons and four double bonds. If R1 is an acyl group and R2 is a hydrogen then the molecule is a 1-acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine. If R1 is a hydrogen and R2 is an acyl group then the molecule is a 2-acyl-&lt;em&gt;sn&lt;/em&gt;-glycero-3-phosphoethanolamine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
