        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24431"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A diverse group of pharmacologically active secondary metabolite characteristic to &lt;em&gt;Cannabis&lt;/em&gt; plant as well as produced naturally in the body by humans and animals. Cannabinoids contain oxygen as a part of the heterocyclic ring or in the form of various functional groups. They are subdivided on the basis of their origin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
