        <obo:IAO_0000115>A racemate composed of equimolar amounts of (&lt;i&gt;R&lt;/i&gt;)- and (&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;)-miconazole. Used (as its nitrate salt) to treat skin infections such as athlete&apos;s foot, jock itch, ringworm and other fungal skin infections. It inhibits the synthesis of ergosterol, a critical component of fungal cell membranes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
