        <obo:IAO_0000115>An aromatic amide obtained by formal condensation of the carboxy group of 2-{[(4-{&lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;&apos;-[(hexyloxy)carbonyl]carbamimidoyl}phenyl)amino]methyl}-1-methyl-1&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;-benzimidazole-5-carboxylic acid with the secondary amino group of ethyl &lt;em&gt;N&lt;/em&gt;-pyridin-2-yl-β-alaninate. A prodrug for dabigatran, a thrombin inhibitor and anticoagulant which is used for the prevention of stroke and systemic embolism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
