        <obo:IAO_0000115>A 28-membered appetite-stimulating polypeptide consisting of Gly, Ser, Ser(octanoyl), Phe, Leu, Ser, Pro, Glu, His, Gln, Arg, Val, Gln, Gln, Arg, Lys, Glu, Ser, Lys, Lys, Pro, Pro, Ala, Lys, Leu, Gln, Pro and Arg residues joined in sequence. The &lt;em&gt;O&lt;/em&gt;-&lt;em&gt;n&lt;/em&gt;-octanoylation of the side-chain hydroxy group of serine-3 (Ser3) is essential for ghrelin&apos;s activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
