        <obo:IAO_0000115>A butenolide that is furan-2(5&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;)-one substituted by a phenyl group at position 3 and by a &lt;em&gt;p&lt;/em&gt;-(methylsulfonyl)phenyl group at position 4. A selective cyclooxygenase 2 inhibitor, it was used from 1999 to 2004 for the treatment of ostoarthritis, but was withdrawn following concerns about an associated increased risk of heart attack and stroke.</obo:IAO_0000115>
