        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_24532"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of hexahydronaphthalenes that is lovastatin in which the 2-methylbutyrate ester moiety has been replaced by a 2,2-dimethylbutyrate ester group. It is used as a cholesterol-lowering and anti-cardiovascular disease drug.</obo:IAO_0000115>
