        <obo:IAO_0000115>A racemate comprising equimolar amounts of dexverapamil and (&lt;i&gt;S&lt;/i&gt;)-verapamil. An L-type calcium channel blocker of the phenylalkylamine class, it is used (particularly as the hydrochloride salt) in the treatment of hypertension, angina pectoris and cardiac arrhythmia, and as a preventive medication for migraine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
